PRINTFORML How Many More Di🅰️pers Do We Need In Lunarian Grounds
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
SETFONT "ＭＳ Ｐゴシック"
FONTITALIC 
PRINTFORML We've gotten lazy due to the advent of di🅰️pers being imported into Lunarian grounds.
PRINTFORML Our f!lth is being layered all over the trash cans, the smell emitting from the entire Lunar Capital.
PRINTFORML Why should we have to deal with the waste of Gensokyans and Lunarians not willing using the t🅾️ilet?
PRINTFORML
FONTBOLD
PRINTFORML A rant about Munmates censorship
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML One of the issues with Munmates and other Lunarian-owned media is their unwillingness about talking about f!lth and other present manners.
PRINTFORML Not to mention about their active censorship against these types of discussions
PRINTFORML Countless discussions about this matter were taken down and their accounts banned wrongfully for simply talking about this or leaving a like.
PRINTFORML They say that it's something related to "inciting crimes", but that's just their way of saying censorship.
PRINTFORML Their filter is also extremely awful, as I had to rewrite the article a few times due to how much of words I said get filtered out into circles.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML I'm submitting this article to Bunbunmaru and Kansai Direct. I don't know if they're going to fix the words or even accept my article.
PRINTFORML Though every article I've seen from them is literally unedited and still feels like a rough draft.
PRINTL
FONTBOLD
PRINTFORML Why MB1012 and MB1027 won't help
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML MB1012 and MB1027, the HCAG ban and the "Restrictive Underwear" ban are perhaps two sides to the same coin.
PRINTFORML They are ultimately acts of control punishing Lunarian citizens so that the Watatsukis can exile them for possessing an RU or HCAG.
PRINTFORML They do not stop the importation of these di🅰️pers, as criminals are able to buy them from cash deals and steal them from the bags of Outsiders.
PRINTFORML This also creates the problem of even more waste being created as some Lunarians that still use di🅰️pers have to use more of them per day.
PRINTFORML Furthermore, this also does not target the real problem with the f!lthy di🅰️pers.
PRINTL
FONTBOLD
PRINTFORML Lunarians with regressing p🅾️tty training increases to 33\%
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML The Lunarian work ethic and the advent of new disposable di🅰️pers means that Lunarians are being very lazy when it comes to using the toilet.
PRINTFORML 1 in 3 Lunarians have some sort of bladder or bowel regression according to E!nitei and other current Bunbunmaru posts.
PRINTFORML It's not that going in an absorbent garment is more convenient or that they don't need to go to the toilet.
PRINTFORML The time it takes to change as well as the changes needed ultimately makes the efficiency thing moot.
PRINTFORML It's that there's not enough incentive to use the t🅾️ilet, to keep our workplaces smelling fresh and not having p3e stains.
PRINTFORML A monetary bonus for using the t🅾️ilet is a good way to help make us motivated to use the bathroom properly.
PRINTL
FONTBOLD
PRINTFORML Makai and their obsession with di🅰️pers and inc🅾️ntinence
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML The real problem comes down to Makai.
PRINTFORML This "Gensou-chan" company has been pushing absorbent garments like their di🅰️pers ever since they established themselves in the Otherworld.
PRINTFORML You see constant ads for them on Planck, Bunbunmaru, Kansai Direct, and pretty much every single Gensokyan and Makai media company.
PRINTFORML Stalls selling their products in the Lunar Capital keep appearing before swiftly getting shut down, and nearly every search they do on an exiled resident has at least a case of Gensou-chan products.
PRINTFORML Every bathroom waste bin that I rummage through has at least one "FantastaBab", which is a Gensou-chan product.
PRINTFORML I've seen videos of the Pandemonium in Makai and each bedroom has a changing table with FantataBabs and a pail on the side!
PRINTFORML Every single self-proclaimed Makai has one of them on in every video I've seen, and one in four Gensokyans are wearing them too as well.
PRINTFORML Why are we letting these guys in? They are the epitome of f!lth and corruption.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML HCAGS and RUs are not the issue, Makai is.
PRINTFORML LUNARIAN FIRST, FWNT, FWNY!
FONTITALIC
PRINTL
PRINTFORML - A disgruntled Lunarian
FONTREGULAR
SETFONT
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
